		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "Reports suggest, incredibly\npowerful monster with \"Fear\"<1\"\u0000>\nattribute, roaming inside\nvolcano. Also says, this<1\"\u0000>\ncreature on fire...",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "Oho! You're a Denpa Men, aren't\nya! I'm the Incarnation<1\"\u0000>\nof Earth, \"<17\u0003>{9, MonsterParameter, +}<2ï耀>{3, name, +}\n.\nI've just woke up so my<1\"\u0000>\nis still a little stiff.\nWhat ya say? Wanna join me<1\"\u0000>\nfor a little exercise?",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "Nyahahaha! That kind of\nboldness is truly admireable!<1\"\u0000>\nNo need to holb back!\nCome at me with everything<1\"\u0000>\nyou've got!!",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "Oh, too bad... That's a shame...\nIf you ever feel like it,<1\"\u0000>\ntell me, will ya?\nI'll be waiting.",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "...Are you now interested?",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "Nyahahaha! Didn't think I would\nsay this again but yeah!<1\"\u0000>\nI haven't met someone so\nstrong in a long time!<1\"\u0000>\nThat was fun! Come challenge\nme anytime! Good luck on<1\"\u0000>\nyour adventure, Denpa Men.",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "I'm the Elder Water Fairy\nknown as \"<17\u0003>{8, MessageNpcName, +}<2@耀>{4, message}\".<1\"\u0000>\nI have been waiting for the\narrival of the one who<1\"\u0000>\npossesses the \"<17\u0003>{5, ItemData, +}<2¶耀>{3, name, +}\".\nOh, bearer of the token,<1\"\u0000>\nI shall lend you my strength -\nhowever modest it may be - for<1\"\u0000>\nyour adventure.",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "I look forward to working\nwith you from now on.<1\"\u0000>\nWell then, I'll head\nover to your island first.<1\"\u0000>\nI pray with all my heart\nthat you will return to the<1\"\u0000>\nisland safely.",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "I look forward to working with\nyou... Oh?<1\"\u0000>\nUnfortunately, it seems there's\nno space left in your<1\"\u0000>\nDenpa Men Box. If a spot is\navailable, please notify me.",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "I see...\nThat's too bad, but there's<1\"\u0000>\nnothing we can do about it\nas it seems.",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "I will go ahead to your island.\nWhen you return to the<1\"\u0000>\nisland, I will put my strength\nto good use in your<1\"\u0000>\nfuture adventures.",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "When the Denpa Men Box has an\navailable spot, please<1\"\u0000>\nnotify me again.",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "Do you need my help now?",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "I'm the Elder Earth Fairy\nknown as \"<17\u0003>{8, MessageNpcName, +}<2>耀>{4, message}\".<1\"\u0000>\nI have been waiting for the\none possessing the <17\u0003>{5, ItemData, +}<2´耀>{3, name, +}.<1\"\u0000>\nYou, the one who holds the\nproof of my element shall be<1\"\u0000>\nprovided my strength -\nhowever modest it may<1\"\u0000>\nbe - for your adventure.",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "I look forward to working with\nyou from now on. Well then,<1\"\u0000>\nI'll proceed to your island\nfirst. Please be careful and<1\"\u0000>\nand make sure you return\nto the island safely.",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "...There's a problem. It seems\nto me that there's no space<1\"\u0000>\nleft in your Denpa Men Box.<1\"\u0000>\nIf a spot is made available,\nplease let me know.",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "That's too bad. If you ever need\nmy assistance, please be<1\"\u0000>\nfree to let me know.",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "I will go ahead to your island.\nWhen you safely return to<1\"\u0000>\nthe island, I will put my\nstrength to good use in<1\"\u0000>\nyour following adventures.",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "When a spot is made available\nin the Denpa Men Box, please<1\"\u0000>\nbe free to let me know.",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
			"manualOffset": 0,
			"hasManualOffset": false
		},
		{
			"text_contents": "Do you need my help?",
			"hasEntryInOffsetOffsets": true,
			"noTerminator": false,
